    "y+2=3(x+1)",
    "y=3x",
    "3x−y+1=0"
   ],
   "answer": 0,
   "explain": "点斜式直接写成 y−2=3(x−1)。"
  },
  {
   "id": "q04",
   "chapterId": "ch02",
   "type": "single",
   "question": "直线 2x−3y+6=0 的斜率是：",
   "options": [
    "2/3",
    "−2/3",
    "3/2",
    "−3/2"
   ],
   "answer": 0,
   "explain": "k=−A/B=−2/(−3)=2/3。"
  },
  {
   "id": "q05",
   "chapterId": "ch03",
   "type": "single",
   "question": "直线 y=3x+1 与 y=3x−2 的位置关系是：",
   "options": [
    "相交",
    "平行",
    "重合",
    "垂直"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "explain": "斜率相同、截距不同，故平行。"
  },
  {
   "id": "q06",
   "chapterId": "ch03",
   "type": "single",
   "question": "点 (2,1) 到直线 x−y+1=0 的距离是：",
   "options": [
    "2",
    "√2",
    "1",
    "2√2"
   ],
   "answer": 1,
   "explain": "|2−1+1|/√2=2/√2=√2。"
  },
  {
   "id": "q07",
   "chapterId": "__all__",
   "type": "single",
   "question": "过点 (0,2) 且与直线 y=2x+1 平行的直线方程是：",
   "options": [
    "y=2x+2",
    "y=−2x+2",
    "y=x+2",
    "y=2x−2"
   ],
   "answer": 0,
   "explain": "平行则斜率相同为 2，过 (0,2) 得 y=2x+2。"
  },
  {
   "id": "q08",
   "chapterId": "__all__",
   "type": "single",
   "question": "直线 3x+4y−10=0 与 3x+4y+5=0 之间的距离是：",
   "options": [
    "3",
    "15",
    "5",
    "1"
   ],
   "answer": 0,
   "explain": "d=|−10−5|/√(9+16)=15/5=3。"
  }
